## Skills (workflows)

- Vertical slices: `read-endpoint`, `write-endpoint`
- Building blocks: `domain-entity`, `domain-repository`, `prisma-repository`, `feature-module`, `presentation-http`, `authorize-kind`
- Side-effects: `application-port` (WS/SSE publishers — не outbox/RPC)
